{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT<br/>發佈時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：23:28 2026-11-03 HKT</p><img alt=\"八鄉元崗村垃圾站烈焰衝天 消防趕至迅速救熄。FB：錦上路之友\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ff4e19f70a140e3870db6db70246549/2026-11/886744420_2222473765290405_5977008048808830603_n.jpg\"/><p>八鄉元崗村周二（11月3日）晚上10時許有多人報案，指錦上路旁的清潭垃圾站起火。現場圖片所見垃圾站烈焰衝天，途人紛紛躲避。消防接報趕至，迅速將火救熄。火警中暫無受傷報告，起火原因仍在調查；受意外影響，現場交通一度繁忙。</p><p></p><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:41:32.753267+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":192,"images":1,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:28:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:38.866693+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:38:44.888754+00:00","content_hash":"bfe829a345cfabea283dc3ee0af86f81ebe5796fd6e3729013e099b07ff86d7d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}